Listening to a Chinese conversation is as if the words you are listening to, simultaneously trigger a series of short animations that appear before your eyes. No wonder, with its Han Zi (Chinese Script), the characters which are all derived from pictures, tell stories of their own!
Our in-house designed 1-2-3 Learning Cycle fully recognises these and other fundamentals of the Chinese language. We decompose the language to make you see and understand the core of it, at the same time, we just start using it.
All those rulesyou give me, they make my head spin!
Yes, It seemed that teaching methods used, simply couldn’t bridge the gap between Western (non-Chinese) thinking and Chinese thinking, between Western languages and Mandarin. Instead of offering comprehension, rules were offered, and even more rules.
To be able to do so we have enlisted the best teachers and developed our unique teaching concept, yielding results beyond expectation.
