El Astrophytum asterias it is a globular cactus that reaches about 5 centimeters in height and 10cm in diameter native to the southern United States and northern Mexico. There are different cultivars, the most popular being the 'Nudum' that you can see in the image above and the 'SuperKabuto', which has very beautiful drawings on its fleshy body.
Shipping is epiphytic cactus (that is, they grow on the branches of trees) native to Central and South America, Africa, India and Nepal. There are several species, such as Rhipsalis cereuscula that produces beautiful and curious white flowers, or the Rhipsalis oblongata, which has very, very elegant leaves.
