1 When should succulents be watered?
When should succulents be watered?
Of two things: the place where you live and the climate in your area. Thus, for example, if you live in a place where it rains regularly and is also cold in winter, irrigation will be much less frequent than if you are on the Mediterranean coast, where the sun is the star of the sky for much of the year.
No rain is expected in at least the next seven days if it is summer, or 15-20 if it is any other season.
