El Pachyphytum oviferum It is a crass plant known as moonstone or pachifito. It grows to 10-15 centimeters in height, and has fleshy, very thick, green leaves covered by a whitish wax.
La Rhodiola rosea, known as rhodiola, It is a succulent plant with orange male flowers and purple or garnet female flowers.. Indeed: it is a dioecious plant, and to obtain seeds it is necessary that there be a male and a female specimen blooming at the same time.
El Sedum morganianum, or sedum burrito as it is sometimes known, is a hanging succulent that develops stems up to 30 centimeters long, and from which greenish-blue lanceolate leaves sprout. Its flowers are very small, pink or red, and sprout from the ends of the stems during the summer.
