Plant a cactus in the ground
Now you have to make sure that the soil in your garden is correct, that it drains water well and that it is light. To do this, you have to make a hole of about 50 x 50 centimeters more or less, in the place where you want to put it, and fill it halfway with water.
Then remove it from the pot carefully. If it is large and / or heavy, cover it with cardboard and tie it with rope and then bring it closer to the hole and extract it so that when it comes out you only have to insert it and lift it.
