Cacti, succulents and plants with caudex they are usually plants very resistant to microorganisms that cause diseases . Especially if they have water and fertilizer every time they really need it, it will be very difficult for us to see any signs that there is something wrong.
Worst of all is that fungi, bacteria and viruses are microorganisms that cannot be seen with the naked eye Instead, what we see is the damage they cause ... and when that happens the infection has usually advanced a lot, since they multiply very quickly when the weather is hot and humid. For this reason, symptoms and / or damage will appear especially in spring and summer Also in autumn if the climate we live in is warm or mild.
Well, there are many things we have to do: use a well-drained substrate, control irrigation and fertilization, and know how to act as soon as we see the slightest symptom of disease. However, there are many types of diseases , each with its own characteristics.
