Cookies in the "Function" category are purely functional and necessary for the operation of the website or to implement certain functions. Providers in this category cannot therefore be deactivated.
Cookies in the "Usage" category come from providers who provide certain functionalities or content, such as social media functions, video content, fonts, etc. Providers in this category influence whether all elements on the page function properly .
Cookies in the "Measurement" category come from providers who can analyze access to the website (anonymously, of course). This provides an overview of website performance and how it is developing.
