Google Analytics uses so-called "cookies". These are text files that are saved on your computer and that enable your use of the website to be analyzed.
Google AdSense uses so-called "cookies", text files that are stored on your computer and that enable an analysis of the use of the website. Google AdSense also uses so-called web beacons (invisible graphics).
