Matters needing attention in PCBA soldering
Warehouse management personnel should wear anti-static gloves when sending materials and testing IQC, and use the instrument to reliably ground, and the work surface should be covered with anti-static rubber pads in advance.
During the operation, use an anti-static work surface, and use an anti-static container to hold components and semi-finished products. Some welding equipment can be grounded, and the electric soldering iron must be of anti-static type.
