In actual production, frozen food packaging is prone to the following problems:
The impact resistance of the bag is poor, and it is easily damaged by external forces during transportation, loading and unloading, and shelf placement. It is very easy to break the bag and open the bag, which not only affects the appearance of the packaged product, but also cannot fulfill the packaging itself.
The smoothness of the packaging bag itself is not good, and the production process is characterized by poor opening and low production efficiency. At the same time, it will reduce the utilization rate of the packaging bag and cause a waste of cost.
Insufficient heat sealing strength of the packaging bag and too high heat sealing temperature will cause damage to the heat sealing layer, which will reduce the protection performance of the packaging bag, greatly shorten the shelf life of the contents, and make the contents not reach the corresponding shelf life.
The cold resistance of frozen food is not up to the requirements. In the case of low temperature, the original performance of the material cannot be maintained, and the packaging material is brittle, which reduces the mechanical strength of the packaging material, causing the packaging bag to rupture and crack, and it cannot meet the requirements.
