PVC gloves and PE gloves are mostly transparent, and it is difficult to distinguish them when worn on the hand. If you look closely, you will find that they are actually quite different, which can be distinguished by the following points:
Material PVC gloves are made of PVC paste resin, plasticizer, stabilizer, viscosity reducer, PU, and softened water as the main raw materials, which are made through a special process.
PVC gloves are elastic, PE gloves do not, and the softness of PVC gloves is slightly better. This is the reason why PVC gloves have different sizes and PE gloves do not.
Features PVC gloves do not contain allergens; low dust generation, low ion content; resistance to a certain pH; strong tensile strength; low price, convenient and comfortable to wear.
PE gloves are mostly used in household cleaning, food, sanitation, industrial and agricultural protection, hair dyeing, care washing, dining, etc., for very simple protective operations.
